<title>USA: Big Flower Press names Ritchie as CFO.</title>
<headline>Big Flower Press names Ritchie as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Flower Press Holdings said it named Richard Ritchie executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Ritchie, 50, had been with Harte-Hanks Communications for 10 years where he served as senior vice president and chief financial and accounting officer. Richie will be responsible for all finance and controllership functions at Big Flower.</p>
</text>
